# Uploaded signatures (Settings > ID card signature / Certificate signatures).
# Never committed, so a deploy cannot overwrite or delete them; on a new server
# upload the real ones through the app. sg-signature-placeholder.png stays in git.
/public/images/id-card/sg-signature.png
/public/images/signatures/*
!/public/images/signatures/.gitkeep

